# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# On Vercel, set the same variables under Project → Settings → Environment
# Variables (they are NOT read from .env.local in a deployment).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# REQUIRED FOR LEAD DELIVERY.
# Where every quote / sample / contact submission is POSTed as JSON.
# Until this is set, enquiries are only written to the server log and NOBODY
# is notified — see app/api/enquiry/route.ts.
#
# Any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST works:
#   - Zapier   "Catch Hook"      → https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/...
#   - Make.com "Custom webhook"  → https://hook.eu2.make.com/...
#   - n8n      "Webhook" node
#   - Google Apps Script web app (doPost) → https://script.google.com/macros/s/.../exec
#
# A good Zap/Scenario: on hook → send email to both partners + append a row to
# a Google Sheet + (optional) send a WhatsApp via a provider.
MGM_WEBHOOK_URL=
